    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In both its establishment and promotion of a digital economy, Kenya is one of Africa's leading countries. Through the use of digital finance solutions like M-PESA, such innovations are facilitating transactions and spurring trade for corporations, small and medium enterprises (SMEs), and individuals. This has improved efficiency, accessibility, connectedness, and better standards of living.",
